## CQ-SINK-01
@group client
@commands BR-53 and BR-55: first person, walk slowly slime -> honey -> slime, wool -> mud -> wool, wool -> dirt path; walk to a wool edge over a 1-block drop
@pass LOOK: no upward pop at any seam; at the edge the view stays sunk until you fall
@fails `SinkingRender.depthAt` corner fallback; `support` top check
